# QA Lab: Jira project keys
#   JIRA_PROJECT_KEY = source project for HUs/JQL/sprints (used by preview and TestLaunch)
#   JIRA_DEFECT_PROJECT_KEY = destination project for defect creation (used by DefectChecklist)
#   JIRA_DEFECT_ISSUE_TYPE = issue type for defects (check createmeta log for valid types)
